  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_main0160_rival_01",
      "hash": "b7318e41cd49272e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]：啊！\\n你来得正好！"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_main0160_rival_02",
      "hash": "b7318d41cd49257b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]！这个城市里\\n设有[VAR COLOR(0006)]宝可梦道馆[VAR COLOR(0000)]，\\c\\n训练家在那里可以和\\n实力雄厚的[VAR COLOR(0006)]道馆馆主[VAR COLOR(0000)]对战！"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main0160_rival_05",
      "hash": "b7319241cd492dfa",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "虽说道馆馆主不好对付，\\n可为了变强就必须要面对挑战！"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main0160_rival_04",
      "hash": "b7319341cd492fad",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]：噢～！\\n[VAR PKNICK(0003)]也很想对战是吧！\\r\\n是吧！\\c\\n好了！我会为你们加油的，\\n这是我的一点心意！"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main0160_sys_01",
      "hash": "ca5507f550d8c8dd",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]从[VAR TRNAME(0001)]那里\\n得到了５个伤药！"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main0160_rival_03",
      "hash": "b7318c41cd4923c8",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我用至今为止存来的奖金\\n把[VAR TRNAME(0000)]的份也买了！\\c\\n等你战胜了道馆馆主，\\n你就是个够格的训练家了！\\r\\n加油吧！"
    }
  ],
  "unpaired_labels": [
    {
      "id": "msg_main_event_0160_max",
      "hash": "c236098b0fcb014a"
    }
  ]
}
